{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53939","headline":"立赠河西悟真法师 · 有孚","name":"立赠河西悟真法师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙徼虏尘清，天亲入帝京。\n词华推翘类，经论许纵横。\n幸喜乾坤泰，忻逢日月明。\n还乡报连[帅]（师），相宁□昇平。\n（同前。\n原署：「内供奉文章应制大德有孚。\n」）（按：有孚，疑即《全唐诗》、《全唐诗补逸》已收之元孚。\n元孚大中间自署爲「上都左街保寿寺文章应制内供奉」，与有孚所署合。\n元、有二字，音亦相近，疑有抄误。\n今仍分列，以俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"有孚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}